WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.624 --> 00:00:01.493
- Oh!
- [Girl] Oh! (laughs)

00:00:01.493 --> 00:00:02.828
- I didn't, yeah, you go ahead.

00:00:02.828 --> 00:00:03.579
- Oh, are you sure?

00:00:03.579 --> 00:00:04.705
- Yeah, yeah, no problem.

00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:05.922
- [Girl] Thank you!

00:00:06.081 --> 00:00:06.749
- Nice.

00:00:06.749 --> 00:00:08.341
(awkward laughter)

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.613
- [Girl] I Ned just going
to watch me get coffee?

00:00:10.613 --> 00:00:11.503
(pleasant music)

00:00:11.503 --> 00:00:13.514
This is so intimate.

00:00:14.631 --> 00:00:15.591
D'you have a good weekend?

00:00:15.591 --> 00:00:17.217
- Oh, yeah, yeah, I was
about to ask you that.

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:18.636
- Yeah, (laughs) I did!

00:00:18.636 --> 00:00:19.762
- (laughs) Me too, me too.

00:00:19.762 --> 00:00:21.479
- (laughs) Good.

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:23.640
Oh, hey!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.025
- [Ned] Hey!

00:00:26.685 --> 00:00:28.979
- [Girl] Interesting seating choice, sir!

00:00:28.979 --> 00:00:30.063
Why did he sit next to me

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:32.024
when there are all these empty chairs?

00:00:32.024 --> 00:00:33.609
This definitely means something.

00:00:33.609 --> 00:00:35.402
- You know what this meeting is about?

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:38.079
- Yeah, I just prepared a little bit.

00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:39.406
- Hey, Chris!

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:40.532
Come on, sit over here.

00:00:40.532 --> 00:00:42.417
- [Chris] Oh, hey, what's up?

00:00:42.951 --> 00:00:44.244
- Oh my god, are you still hungover?

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:45.954
- I can barely move from place to place.

00:00:45.954 --> 00:00:46.871
- [Girl] (scoffs) Whatever.

00:00:46.871 --> 00:00:48.298
I'm super busy.

00:00:48.373 --> 00:00:49.924
- [Ned] (sighs) Hi!

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.885
- [Girl] Well, hello! (laughs)

00:00:54.045 --> 00:00:55.380
(laughs)

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:56.548
This is such a coincidence.

00:00:56.548 --> 00:00:58.099
Twice in one day?

00:00:59.593 --> 00:01:01.687
(whispers) I think he's obsessed with me!

00:01:01.762 --> 00:01:02.721
- Too much coffee, huh?

00:01:02.721 --> 00:01:04.222
- (laughing) I have a very small bladder!

00:01:04.222 --> 00:01:05.649
- W-what?

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:08.727
(laughs)

00:01:08.727 --> 00:01:10.779
- He's always touching me!

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:12.272
- Hey!

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.940
Um, Ned was looking for you.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.399
- Oh!

00:01:14.399 --> 00:01:14.983
- Yeah.

00:01:14.983 --> 00:01:17.319
- [Girl] He's finally ready
to tell me his true feelings!

00:01:17.319 --> 00:01:18.236
- I think he just wanted you

00:01:18.236 --> 00:01:20.163
to email him notes on that meeting.

00:01:20.548 --> 00:01:21.997
- Oh, okay.

00:01:21.997 --> 00:01:24.910
- Mm, you should join the
company softball team.

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:25.911
It's a lot of fun!

00:01:25.911 --> 00:01:27.454
- I don't know how to throw things!

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:28.330
- [Ned] Oh, shoot.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:28.914
- [Girl] Wait, is he trying

00:01:28.914 --> 00:01:31.249
to spend time with me outside of work?

00:01:31.249 --> 00:01:32.884
- Oh, Nick!

00:01:33.001 --> 00:01:34.595
You know how to throw things?

00:01:34.795 --> 00:01:36.130
- Oh hell, yeah!

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:37.389
- Yeah!

00:01:37.631 --> 00:01:38.424
- You're in!

00:01:38.424 --> 00:01:39.174
We got a person.

00:01:39.174 --> 00:01:41.235
- Okay, too late, I guess!

00:01:41.235 --> 00:01:42.052
I should have said yes!

00:01:42.052 --> 00:01:43.887
He wants to see me outside of work!

00:01:43.887 --> 00:01:45.847
- Ned had a lot of really
great things to say about you!

00:01:45.847 --> 00:01:46.640
- Oh, really?

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:49.184
Maybe Ned thinks our boss
wants us to fall in love.

00:01:49.184 --> 00:01:51.144
- Yeah, he said you really
just took initiative

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:52.854
and took control of that last project.

00:01:52.854 --> 00:01:53.730
That's great.

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:54.397
- Wow!

00:01:54.397 --> 00:01:57.067
I should just grab him and
kiss him in Conference Room B.

00:01:57.067 --> 00:01:58.527
- [Boss] Uh, this way
to our meeting, Allison.

00:01:58.527 --> 00:01:59.319
- Oh, right! (laughs)

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:01.488
I was just thinking about the project.

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:02.789
- Oh.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:04.374
There you go.

00:02:04.908 --> 00:02:06.159
- [Allison] I bet he planned his exit

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.537
so it would be at the same time as me!

00:02:08.537 --> 00:02:10.839
That's so romantic!

00:02:11.414 --> 00:02:12.285
- You're going this way?

00:02:12.285 --> 00:02:12.883
- (laughing) Yeah!

00:02:12.883 --> 00:02:13.800
- Nice.

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:19.080
Do you think Justin and
Quinta are secretly dating?

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:19.673
- I don't know.

00:02:19.673 --> 00:02:21.299
Isn't that against company policy?

00:02:21.299 --> 00:02:23.009
Super subtle, Ned!

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:24.553
- I don't think anyone would care.

00:02:24.553 --> 00:02:25.179
- Who cares?

00:02:25.179 --> 00:02:26.471
I wouldn't care! (laughs)

00:02:26.471 --> 00:02:27.431
Follow your heart.

00:02:27.431 --> 00:02:30.058
- Oh, hey, do you want
to get drinks later?

00:02:30.058 --> 00:02:31.017
- Sure! (laughs)

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:31.726
- Awesome!

00:02:31.726 --> 00:02:36.690
(smooth music)

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.817
- (laughs) I know!

00:02:38.817 --> 00:02:40.944
Oh, man, thanks for coming, Allison.

00:02:40.944 --> 00:02:42.362
You got a hot date later or something?

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:43.113
(Allison laughs)

00:02:43.113 --> 00:02:44.990
- Hey, everybody, cool boss is here.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.940
Shots all around, on me!

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:48.702
- Oh, all right, all right!

00:02:48.702 --> 00:02:49.578
- [Boss] Yup!

00:02:49.578 --> 00:02:50.245
- [Ned] Yeah!

00:02:50.245 --> 00:02:55.245
(Allison screams internally)

00:03:07.172 --> 00:03:09.148
BuzzFeed Presents

